## Why This Is Asked

This question evaluates practical Azure OpenAI deployment for multi-tenant apps, focusing on retrieval augmented generation, versioned knowledge bases, and governance.

## Key Concepts

- Retrieval augmented generation with Azure OpenAI
- Versioned KB in Blob + Cognitive Search
- Per-tenant RBAC via Azure AD
- Latency optimization with caching
- PII redaction and regional constraints

## Code Example

```javascript
// Example: compose prompt from KB snippets
async function inferWithRAG(query, tenantId){
  const snippets = await searchKB(query, tenantId);
  const prompt = `Tenant: ${tenantId}\nQuery: ${query}\nSnippets:\n${snippets.map(s=>s.text).join('\n')}`;
  return await openai.complete({prompt, max_tokens: 512, temperature: 0.2});
}
```

